OL,3,GNEWSA'New busking rules will drain city
OL,4,Aof its life'
OL,5,
OL,6,FBusking restrictions in Coventry have
OL,7,Fsparked a backlash from campaigners,
OL,8,Fwho warned the measures could "drain
OL,9,Fthe city of its life".
OL,11,FUnder the updated Public Spaces
OL,12,FProtection Order (PSPO), buskers using
OL,13,Famplification equipment must apply
OL,14,Fthrough Coventry City Council's event
OL,15,Fbooking process, which requires at
OL,16,Fleast 28 days' notice, providing a risk
OL,17,Fassessment and site plan.
OL,23,APub: 24-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,355,350,200,160,0,100
