OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,$A(W)
OL,3,GNEWSA'New busking rules will drain city
OL,4,Aof its life'
OL,5,
OL,6,FJosie Appleton, director of the
OL,7,FCampaign for Freedom in Everyday Life,
OL,8,Fsaid this was "completely unfeasible"
OL,9,Fand had "closed the city off for
OL,10,Fordinary, everyday use".
OL,12,F"It is a great shame and I am urging
OL,13,Fthe council to think again," she said.
OL,14,FThe authority has been asked to comment
OL,15,Fafter the policy came in on Saturday.
OL,23,APub: 24-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
